    <widget type="textupdate" version="2.0.0">
      <name>M100Ch0</name>
      <pv_name>$(P):CH0:FBR_MEAN_100MS</pv_name>
      <width>85</width>
      <height>32</height>
      <format>3</format>
      <precision>2</precision>
      <show_units>false</show_units>
      <horizontal_alignment>1</horizontal_alignment>
      <vertical_alignment>1</vertical_alignment>
      <tooltip>$(P):CH0:FBR_MEAN_100MS (CH0_FBR_MEAN_100MS)

Mean of the newest $(P):CH0:MEAN_WIN_100MS points of
$(P):CH0:FBR_RT_100MS_3000DP.

Unit cnt/100ms: the averaged points are bucket sums, so the result is
counts per bucket and is directly comparable with that waveform and
with $(P):CH0:FBR_ILK_TH_100MS. While the ring holds fewer points
than the window, this is the mean of all points available.
Updated at about 10 Hz.</tooltip>
      <border_alarm_sensitive>false</border_alarm_sensitive>
    </widget>
