  <widget type="group" version="3.0.0">
    <name>Selected channel</name>
    <x>680</x>
    <y>228</y>
    <width>490</width>
    <height>90</height>
    <font>
      <font name="Header 3" family="Liberation Sans" style="BOLD" size="16.0">
      </font>
    </font>
    <widget type="textupdate" version="2.0.0">
      <name>SelMean</name>
      <pv_name>$(P):CH$(CH):FBR_MEAN_$(SCALE)</pv_name>
      <width>140</width>
      <height>32</height>
      <format>3</format>
      <precision>2</precision>
      <show_units>false</show_units>
      <horizontal_alignment>1</horizontal_alignment>
      <vertical_alignment>1</vertical_alignment>
      <tooltip>$(P):CH$(CH):FBR_MEAN_$(SCALE)

Mean of the newest points of the plotted waveform, however many this
channel's window selects, in counts per bucket. Same value as the matching
cell of the three groups on the left, repeated here so the curve and the
number being checked sit together.</tooltip>
      <border_alarm_sensitive>false</border_alarm_sensitive>
    </widget>
    <widget type="label" version="2.0.0">
      <name>SelMeanLabel</name>
      <text>Selected mean</text>
      <y>32</y>
      <width>140</width>
      <height>22</height>
      <horizontal_alignment>1</horizontal_alignment>
    </widget>
    <widget type="textupdate" version="2.0.0">
      <name>SelWin</name>
      <pv_name>$(P):CH$(CH):MEAN_WIN_$(SCALE)</pv_name>
      <x>150</x>
      <width>140</width>
      <height>32</height>
      <format>1</format>
      <precision>0</precision>
      <horizontal_alignment>1</horizontal_alignment>
      <vertical_alignment>1</vertical_alignment>
      <tooltip>$(P):CH$(CH):MEAN_WIN_$(SCALE)
(MEAN_WIN_CH$(CH)_$(SCALE))

Window length the plotted channel uses on the plotted scale, read back
from its setpoint record. Edit it with the entry under that channel in
the group for that scale on the left.</tooltip>
      <border_alarm_sensitive>false</border_alarm_sensitive>
    </widget>
    <widget type="label" version="2.0.0">
      <name>SelWinLabel</name>
      <text>Selected window</text>
      <x>150</x>
      <y>32</y>
      <width>140</width>
      <height>22</height>
      <horizontal_alignment>1</horizontal_alignment>
    </widget>
  </widget>
  <widget type="xyplot" version="3.0.0">
    <name>FbrRt</name>
    <x>15</x>
    <y>485</y>
    <width>1150</width>
    <height>390</height>
    <title>FBR realtime CH$(CH) $(SCALE)</title>
    <show_toolbar>true</show_toolbar>
    <tooltip>$(P):CH$(CH):FBR_RT_$(SCALE)_3000DP

The 3000 newest buckets of one channel at one time scale, the same ring snapshot
the FBR_MEAN_$(SCALE) scalar is averaged over. The newest point is at the right
hand end, so the window whose mean is displayed is that channel's trailing
MEAN_WIN_$(SCALE) points of this edge.</tooltip>
    <x_axis>
      <title>X</title>
      <autoscale>true</autoscale>
      <log_scale>false</log_scale>
      <minimum>0.0</minimum>
      <maximum>100.0</maximum>
      <show_grid>true</show_grid>
      <title_font>
        <font name="Default Bold" family="Liberation Sans" style="BOLD" size="14.0">
        </font>
      </title_font>
      <scale_font>
        <font name="Default" family="Liberation Sans" style="REGULAR" size="14.0">
        </font>
      </scale_font>
      <visible>true</visible>
    </x_axis>
    <y_axes>
      <y_axis>
        <title>Y</title>
        <autoscale>true</autoscale>
        <log_scale>false</log_scale>
        <minimum>0.0</minimum>
        <maximum>100.0</maximum>
        <show_grid>true</show_grid>
        <title_font>
          <font name="Default Bold" family="Liberation Sans" style="BOLD" size="14.0">
          </font>
        </title_font>
        <scale_font>
          <font name="Default" family="Liberation Sans" style="REGULAR" size="14.0">
          </font>
        </scale_font>
        <on_right>false</on_right>
        <visible>true</visible>
        <color>
          <color name="Text" red="0" green="0" blue="0">
          </color>
        </color>
      </y_axis>
    </y_axes>
    <traces>
      <trace>
        <name>FBR</name>
        <x_pv></x_pv>
        <y_pv>$(P):CH$(CH):FBR_RT_$(SCALE)_3000DP</y_pv>
        <err_pv></err_pv>
        <axis>0</axis>
        <trace_type>1</trace_type>
        <color>
          <color red="0" green="0" blue="255">
          </color>
        </color>
        <line_width>1</line_width>
        <line_style>0</line_style>
        <point_type>0</point_type>
        <point_size>10</point_size>
        <visible>true</visible>
      </trace>
    </traces>
  </widget>
  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0">
    <name>Copyright</name>
    <text>(C) 2026 IMPCAS | Beam Feedback Group | Ren Fei</text>
    <x>60</x>
